                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Naomi Calder"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I spent fifteen years inside growing companies: first as an analyst at a regional grocery chain, then as COO of a 180-person outdoor retailer through three acquisitions. I started Calder Advisory in 2019 to help founders get through the awkward middle of growth with fewer scars than I collected."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I live in south Minneapolis with my partner, two teenagers and a very old dog."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
